{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2022-04-01 11:04:00', 'title': 'PNC RAISES COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND TO $1.50 PER SHARE', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH , APRIL 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF THE PNC FINANCIAL SERVICES GROUP, INC. (NYSE: PNC) DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON THE COMMON STOCK OF $1.50 PER SHARE, AN INCREASE OF 25 CENTS PER SHARE, OR 20%, FROM THE FOURTH QUARTER DIVIDEND OF $1.25 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE MAY 5, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS APRIL 13, 2022.'}